{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01En7RTAbceZfFLKnJXw5p9w","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tReview type: technical peer review\n2\tScope: all documents in KB\n3\t\n4\tReview the seismic hazard study sections provided in KB. For each section:\n5\t- Verify that the technical methodology follows current standards and references\n6\t- Check if equations and formulations are correctly stated\n7\t- Identify gaps in reasoning or missing justifications\n8\t- Verify consistency of notation across sections\n9\t- Check if references are current and relevant\n10\t\n11\tThe review must be in ENGLISH.\n12\t\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e5655a3d-d1a5-49f5-9bdd-236b5edf4893","uuid":"b3a07469-48b7-49e7-820d-7df0598e7f1a","timestamp":"2026-03-30T00:40:57.278Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/averri/github/tools/tito-examples/review/psha/tasks/task.md","content":"Review type: technical peer review\nScope: all documents in KB\n\nReview the seismic hazard study sections provided in KB. For each section:\n- Verify that the technical methodology follows current standards and references\n- Check if equations and formulations are correctly stated\n- Identify gaps in reasoning or missing justifications\n- Verify consistency of notation across sections\n- Check if references are current and relevant\n\nThe review must be in ENGLISH.\n","numLines":12,"startLine":1,"totalLines":12}}}
